    "BIOA_LAV00_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_01_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u02581",
   "en": "Message coming in. Patching it through.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE25_00_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_LAV00_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_01_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u02582",
   "en": "You need to turn back, Commander. You're going beyond the range of the operational area.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE25_00_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_LAV00_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_01_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u02583",
   "en": "You went right off the scanners, Commander. Now we have to bring you back.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE25_00_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_LAV00_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_01_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u02584",
   "en": "I prefer gold to silver. You know, for my medal. I figured you'd recommend me for one since I pulled your, uh, boots out of the fire.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE25_00_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_LAV00_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_01_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u02585",
   "en": "Ah, figures. Just get me a nice card and a cake. No coconut, though. I hate that crap.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE25_00_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_LAV00_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_01_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u02586",
   "en": "That's a good point. They'd probably make me shave, too. I spent the last seven weeks working on this baby. No medal's worth that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE25_00_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_LAV00_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_01_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u02587",
   "en": "Oh, I get it. It's supposed to be a surprise. Don't worry. When they pin it on my chest, I'll pretend I had no idea it was coming.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE25_00_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_LAV00_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_01_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u02588",
   "en": "So, Commander, why don't you tell me why you're really here?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE25_00_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_LAV00_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_01_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u02589",
   "en": "Boy am I glad to be off Noveria. I don't know which was worse: the cold or the corporations.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE25_00_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_LAV00_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_01_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u02590",
   "en": "One will freeze your balls off, the other will sell 'em out from under you. With all due respect, Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE25_00_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_LAV00_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_01_DSG_LOC"
   ]
